&lt;div style=&quot; margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 7.9875in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot; margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 7.9875in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot; border-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot; margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 7.9875in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot; margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 7.9875in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Sustainable Talent&lt;/span&gt; is partnering with &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;NVIDIA,&lt;/span&gt; a global leader that has been transforming computer graphics, PC gaming, and accelerated computing for over 25 years, to find a &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Senior Paid Media Manager, B2B &amp;amp; Developer Marketing&lt;/span&gt; for its &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;B2B Marketing team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;W-2 contract&lt;/span&gt; position based in &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Santa Clara, CA&lt;/span&gt; offering a &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;remote/hybrid&lt;/span&gt; work model. We offer competitive pay of &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;$60-$70/hr&lt;/span&gt; based on experience, education, and location, plus full benefits, PTO, and an amazing company culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&#39;s technology powers the AI revolution, and the developers building on it are one of the most technical, discerning audiences in B2B. In this senior individual contributor role, you&#39;ll own paid media for NVIDIA&#39;s developer and enterprise programs end to end, from strategy and launch through optimization and executive reporting. You&#39;ll have real autonomy, regular visibility with senior leadership, and agency partners to execute alongside you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Own B2B paid campaigns end to end across Google Ads (Search, Display, Discovery), YouTube, and LinkedIn, plus Reddit, X, Meta, and Digital OOH where they fit&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Build campaign proposals with strategy, targeting, KPIs, and budget recommendations for complex technical products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Conduct keyword research, audience targeting, and competitor analysis with a focus on developer personas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Monitor performance closely, diagnose underperforming campaigns, and course correct quickly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Lead paid strategy for YouTube keynotes, live premieres, webinars, and virtual events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Present results and recommendations to senior leadership and cross-functional teams, turning complex channel data into clear, compelling narratives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Serve as a strategic lead and consultant to the agencies and partners who execute campaigns on NVIDIA&#39;s behalf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Use AI tools like Claude and Codex to automate reporting, speed up analysis, and improve campaign workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What we need to see&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• 5+ years of hands-on B2B paid media experience, including campaigns for technology, software, AI, or developer-focused products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Agency experience (agency or agency plus in-house) managing complex, fast-moving programs on tight deadlines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Deep expertise in Google Ads, YouTube Ads, and LinkedIn Campaign Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Proven experience reaching developer or technical audiences, with a strong understanding of how they research and evaluate products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Strong analytical skills, with Adobe Analytics experience strongly preferred (Tableau, Marketo, and Google Analytics are a plus)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Confidence presenting to senior leaders and pushing back with data when a strategy won&#39;t work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Comfort with ambiguity, including moving quickly, making sound decisions with incomplete information, and owning outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ways to stand out from the crowd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Experience marketing APIs, SDKs, open-source models, developer platforms, cloud, or infrastructure software&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Hands-on use of AI tools such as Claude or Codex to improve marketing workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• Experience with pixel implementation, attribution, and paid media dashboards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;• A clear understanding of how paid media fits into the broader B2B buyer and developer journey&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Please note: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;This role is 100% focused on B2B paid media. It is not an organic social, content, or B2C performance marketing role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;Sustainable Talent is a M/F+, disabled, and veteran equal employment opportunity and affirmative action employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
